  "important_design_constraints": [
    "Keep the background darker than the earlier version so it matches the other Focus Sprint pages.",
    "Do not use a filled orb here; use a hollow glowing progress ring.",
    "The screen should feel calmer and less meditative than the breathwork screen.",
    "Preserve the premium Bodhi visual language: deep navy-black background, subtle vertical light streaks, glowing purple accents, rounded cards, clean modern typography.",
    "Keep width proportions close to the reference.",
    "Slightly loosen vertical spacing so the screen breathes better in height.",
    "Do not add bottom navigation.",
    "Do not make the UI look like a generic productivity app or neon gaming UI.",
    "Maintain excellent readability and a polished premium aesthetic."
